recommend keep-going the stereo dynamics family grows from here; the next crux is ALES60's downward expander carried into stereo (stereo_expand) — the compressor inverted below the threshold, again a linked gain (key = max, a quiet pair expanded together so the image holds) — agent-doable, no gate reached, witness GREEN, TAME clean.
